Replay support: PS2Runtime::saveGuestHeapState and restoreGuestHeapState, PS2Vfs::nextDescriptor and closeFrom. The guest heap's bookkeeping and the VFS descriptor counter live outside RDRAM, so a test that replays one call from the same RDRAM image twice (the port's differential test) otherwise sees a different malloc block and file descriptor on the second run.

